  unitName: Royal Dragon Farvnil
  unitId: 30514
  unitNumber: 763
  description: An ancient dragon that awoke in Bariura. As Farvnil continued with
    its disastrous rampage, a young woman appeared to confront it stating that if
    the dragon indeed possessed any intelligence, then it would know to use its words
    before diving into a fight. Perplexed by not only her words, but her fearlessness
    in his presence, it calmed down for an instant. However, at that very moment
    another human sought this opportunity to attack Farvnil, gravely injuring it.
    Driven mad with anger, the ancient creature gained even more power than before
    thanks to a dark presence by its side.
  summonDesc: I will not pledge myself to a human.<br>However, my will is absent.<br>Human
    wisdom is an abomination.
  fusionDesc: My soul won't heal at this rate...<br>Human...<br>Sacrifice more souls
    to me...
  evoDesc: I won't forgive...you human...<br>My body...my soul...<br>To have to give
    myself to this world...
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
